<title>BELGIUM: Martens to head Euro Parliament group until 1999.</title>
<headline>Martens to head Euro Parliament group until 1999.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Former Belgian prime minister and Euro deputy Wilfried Martens was re-elected on Wednesday chairman of the European People's Party group within the European Parliament, the EPP said in a statement.</p>
<p>Martens is also president of the wider EPP, which groups Christian Democratic parties from across western and eastern Europe in a loose federation. He is to hold both positions until 1999, the EPP said.</p>
</text>
